---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import Section from '@/components/Section.astro';

const title = 'Arcana - Terms of Service';
const description = 'Terms of Service for Arcana: Tarot & Palm Reader';
---

<Base head={{ title, description }}>
	<Section>
		<article class="prose prose-gray dark:prose-invert max-w-4xl mx-auto">
			<h1>Terms of Service for Arcana</h1>
			<p class="text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
				Last updated: July 30, 2026
			</p>

			<h2>Agreement</h2>
			<p>
				By downloading or using Arcana: Tarot & Palm Reader ("the app"), you agree to these Terms of Service. The app is operated by Torstein Skulbru, Norway ("we", "us").
			</p>

			<h2>For Reflection and Entertainment Only</h2>
			<p>
				Arcana provides tarot and palmistry readings for reflection, self-exploration, and entertainment purposes only. Readings are generated by an AI language model and by traditional card meanings. They are <strong>not</strong>:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Predictions of the future</li>
				<li>Medical, psychological, legal, or financial advice</li>
				<li>A substitute for consulting a qualified professional</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Do not make significant life decisions based on a reading. If you are struggling, please reach out to a qualified professional or someone you trust.
			</p>

			<h2>Subscriptions and Purchases</h2>
			<p>
				Arcana offers optional purchases, billed by Apple through your App Store account:
			</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>Arcana Plus (weekly)</strong> — auto-renewing subscription with a 3-day free trial. You are charged when the trial ends unless you cancel at least 24 hours before.</li>
				<li><strong>Arcana Plus (annual)</strong> — auto-renewing yearly subscription</li>
				<li><strong>Deck editions</strong> — one-time purchases that remain yours permanently</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Subscriptions renew automatically unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. Manage or cancel anytime in your device Settings → Apple Account → Subscriptions — cancellation takes effect at the end of the paid period. Prices are shown in the app before any purchase, including the annualized cost of weekly plans and the exact trial charge date. Refunds are handled by Apple; request one at <a href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>Fair Use</h2>
			<p>
				AI-generated readings have real per-reading costs. Daily generation limits apply to keep the service sustainable. Attempting to circumvent limits, abuse the reading service, or access it outside the app is prohibited.
			</p>

			<h2>Content and Intellectual Property</h2>
			<p>
				The card imagery in Arcana is reproduced from original printings (1909–1930s) of the Waite-Smith tarot deck, which are in the public domain. The app's scans, presentation, software, and generated readings are our work; you may share readings using the app's share feature for personal, non-commercial use.
			</p>

			<h2>Your Content</h2>
			<p>
				Your questions, notes, and palm photos remain yours. They are stored on your device; see the <a href="/apps/arcana-privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for exactly what is transmitted to generate a reading.
			</p>

			<h2>Availability and Changes</h2>
			<p>
				Personalized readings depend on third-party AI services and may be temporarily unavailable; the app always provides traditional card meanings offline. We may modify or discontinue features, and may update these terms — material changes are reflected in the "Last updated" date above. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance.
			</p>

			<h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
			<p>
				The app is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we disclaim all liability for decisions made or actions taken based on readings, and our total liability is limited to the amount you paid for the app in the preceding 12 months. Nothing in these terms limits rights you have under mandatory consumer protection law, including Norwegian and EU consumer law.
			</p>

			<h2>Age Requirement</h2>
			<p>
				You must be at least 17 years old to use Arcana.
			</p>

			<h2>Governing Law</h2>
			<p>
				These terms are governed by the laws of Norway. Disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of Norwegian courts, without prejudice to mandatory consumer protections in your country of residence.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about these terms? Contact us through the <a href="/apps/arcana-support">support page</a> or via the App Store listing.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-12 p-6 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg">
				<p class="text-sm text-center text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400">
					<a href="/" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">&larr; Back to tskulbru.dev</a> |
					<a href="/apps/arcana-support" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Support</a> |
					<a href="/apps/arcana-privacy" class="hover:text-orange-600 transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a>
				</p>
			</div>
		</article>
	</Section>
</Base>
